  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "没有 Builder 的构建路径",
      "items": [
        "3.x 里 MaterialDialog 自身就是配置入口，title/message/positiveButton 都返回 this 供链式调用",
        "init 块中 dialogBehavior.createView 负责 inflate 根布局，再由 getDialogLayout 强转为 DialogLayout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "按钮回调顺序",
      "items": [
        "DialogActionButtonLayout 用 INDEX_POSITIVE/NEGATIVE/NEUTRAL 给三个按钮绑定同一个分发入口",
        "onActionButtonClicked 先执行本类监听器，再通知列表适配器，最后按 autoDismissEnabled 决定是否 dismiss"
      ]
    }
  ]
